Subject: [PATCH 2/2] arm64: dts: renesas: Add HiHope RZ/G2M board with idk-1110wr display
Date:   Thu, 29 Aug 2019 11:21:47 +0100
Message-Id: <1567074107-4899-3-git-send-email-fabrizio.castro@bp.renesas.com>
