 .../r8a774a1-hihope-rzg2m-ex-idk-1110wr.dts        | 86 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 87 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/r8a774a1-hihope-rzg2m-ex-idk-1110wr.dts

